        "Title": "Fixing Finn Wheeler&apos;s Problem",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111450356448",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ee454990-0c4b-49e5-9572-a67887325283).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, Agent 47.\r\rOur client is a Kronstadt Engineer who goes by the name of Finn Wheeler. Our intel shows that Robert Knox, as well as a few of his employees, have been drinking Fountain View nonstop. So much so, that the only drink to come out of the Fountain View vending machines... Is Dr. Popp. \r\rOur client has complained to HR many times, and many times ignored... so he has turned to us.\r\rTake care of the targets, and buy him a couple drinks while you&apos;re at it.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
